#!/bin/bash
# aro-media -- segmen bar "media" dari MPRIS (MPD lewat mpd-mpris, Sung, Firefox,
# mpv). Mengikuti perubahan langsung (playerctl --follow), tanpa polling.
#   ▶ Artis — Judul   (memutar, terang)      ⏸ Artis — Judul  (jeda, redup)
#   (kosong = tidak ada pemutar -> segmen hilang)
# Klik segmen: playerctl play-pause (tombol media tetap lewat media-key).
set -u
SEG="${XDG_RUNTIME_DIR:?}/aro-bar"; mkdir -p "$SEG"
exec 9>"$SEG/.aro-media.lock"; flock -n 9 || exit 0
MAX="${ARO_MEDIA_MAX:-48}"
put() { printf '%s\n' "$1" > "$SEG/.media.tmp" && mv -f "$SEG/.media.tmp" "$SEG/media"; }
trap 'rm -f "$SEG/media"' EXIT
while true; do
    playerctl --follow metadata --format '{{status}}	{{artist}}	{{title}}' 2>/dev/null |
    while IFS=$'\t' read -r st ar ti; do
        t="${ti:-}"; [ -n "${ar:-}" ] && t="$ar — $t"
        [ "${#t}" -gt "$MAX" ] && t="${t:0:$((MAX - 1))}…"
        case "$st" in
            Playing) put "▶ $t" ;;
            Paused)  put "~⏸ $t" ;;
            *)       put "" ;;
        esac
    done
    put ""; sleep 3          # pemutar terakhir hilang / playerctl keluar: coba lagi
done
